        <div class="box project">
            <div class="columns is-vcentered">
                <div class="column is-one-third">
                    <figure class="image is-3by2">
                        <img src="/src/content/heart-heist-thumb.jpg" alt="Heart Heist screenshot" />
                    </figure>
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    <h2 class="title is-4">3D CPU Renderer (2020)</h2>
                    <p class="subtitle is-6"><em>C++</em> • <strong>Solo Engineer</strong></p>
                    <p>
                        A fast-paced stealth game inspired by <em>Metal Gear Solid</em>, featuring custom AI systems, 
                        reactive guard behaviors, and a focus on expressive player movement.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Designed stealth and AI systems using modular Unity architecture.</li>
                        <li>Built custom FMOD audio integration and visual feedback systems.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <!-- <a href="/heart-heist" class="button is-primary mt-3">Read More</a> -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="box project">
            <div class="columns is-vcentered">
                <div class="column is-one-third">
                    <figure class="image is-3by2">
                        <img src="/src/content/heart-heist-thumb.jpg" alt="Heart Heist screenshot" />
                    </figure>
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    <h2 class="title is-4">Death Tennis (2020)</h2>
                    <p class="subtitle is-6"><em><i>Super Smash Bros.-like 2D Fighter</i></em> • <strong>Level Designer, Artist, Animator</strong></p>
                    <p>
                        A fast-paced stealth game inspired by <em>Metal Gear Solid</em>, featuring custom AI systems, 
                        reactive guard behaviors, and a focus on expressive player movement.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Designed stealth and AI systems using modular Unity architecture.</li>
                        <li>Built custom FMOD audio integration and visual feedback systems.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <!-- <a href="/heart-heist" class="button is-primary mt-3">Read More</a> -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="box project">
            <div class="columns is-vcentered">
                <div class="column is-one-third">
                    <figure class="image is-3by2">
                        <img src="/src/content/heart-heist-thumb.jpg" alt="Heart Heist screenshot" />
                    </figure>
                </div>
                <div class="column">
                    <h2 class="title is-4">Menuapp (2020)</h2>
                    <p class="subtitle is-6"><em>First-Person, Survival, Crafting</em> • <strong>Co-Founder, Full-Stack Engineer</strong></p>
                    <p>
                        A fast-paced stealth game inspired by <em>Metal Gear Solid</em>, featuring custom AI systems, 
                        reactive guard behaviors, and a focus on expressive player movement.
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Designed stealth and AI systems using modular Unity architecture.</li>
                        <li>Built custom FMOD audio integration and visual feedback systems.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <!-- <a href="/heart-heist" class="button is-primary mt-3">Read More</a> -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</StandardPageLayout>

<style>
    body {
        background-color: rgb(229, 186, 235);
        color: black;
    }

    .portfolio-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .box {
        filter: drop-shadow(10px 10px 0px #984eaa);
    }

    .project-thumb {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .project-thumb-video {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 0.5rem 0 0 0.5rem;
    }
</style>